{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"map-title","type":"text","text":"# 📁 Filemap\n\nKey files and folders grouped by purpose. File nodes (with previews) point at the vault docs; text nodes describe paths that Obsidian hides by default (`.claude/`).","x":-1200,"y":-800,"width":800,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-config","type":"text","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration\n\n- `CLAUDE.md` — protocol, routing rules, workflows\n- `.claude/settings.json` — `enabledPlugins`\n- `.claude/settings.local.json` — git allowlist (untracked)\n- `.env.example` → `.env` — `OPENAI_API_KEY`\n- `~/.claude/settings.json` (user-global) — model, theme, plugins","x":-1200,"y":-600,"width":380,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"group-agents","type":"text","text":"## 🤖 Agent Contracts\n\nSingle-file sub-agents (auto-discovered):\n- `.claude/agents/chen.md`\n- `.claude/agents/yael.md`\n- `.claude/agents/yuval.md`\n- `.claude/agents/guy.md`\n\nFolder form (inert — main session):\n- `.claude/agents/ceo/agent.md`\n- `.claude/agents/ceo/_index.md`","x":-780,"y":-600,"width":380,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"group-skills","type":"text","text":"## 🧠 Skills (project-local)\n\n18 skills under `.claude/skills/`. Most relevant:\n- `obsidian-vault-workflow/SKILL.md`\n- `obsidian-markdown/SKILL.md`\n- `obsidian-bases/SKILL.md`\n- `gpt-image-gen/SKILL.md`\n- `brainstorming/SKILL.md`\n- `writing-skills/SKILL.md`\n- `using-superpowers/SKILL.md`\n\n+ TDD, debugging, code-review skills (carryover from Superpowers — candidates for pruning)","x":-360,"y":-600,"width":380,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"group-pipeline","type":"text","text":"## 🔁 Content Pipeline\n\n- `Content/` — raw articles (חן writes, יעל reads)\n- `Output/` — rewritten MD + HTML (יעל writes, גיא audits)\n\nNaming: `<YYYY-MM-DD>-<slug>.md`","x":60,"y":-600,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"group-workspaces","type":"text","text":"## 🗂️ Agent Workspaces\n\n- `chen/Memory/searches.md` — dedup log\n- `yael/style-guide.md` — house style (empty)\n- `yael/reference/` — example texts\n- `yuval/reference/` — style images\n- `yuval/outputs/` — PNG + .txt sidecar\n- `guy/QA_Reports/` — dated QA reports","x":460,"y":-600,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"group-vault","type":"text","text":"## 📚 Vault — Documentation\n\nFolder: `vault/Meeting Notes/`\n\nFile nodes below open each topic doc.","x":-1200,"y":-280,"width":380,"height":140,"color":"2"},
