		{"id":"group-canvas","type":"text","text":"## 🖼️ Visual docs\n\n- `docs/Home.canvas`\n- `docs/Architecture.canvas`\n- `docs/Roadmap.canvas`\n- `docs/Filemap.canvas` *(this canvas)*\n\nObsidian renders `.canvas` directly; the project root contains `.obsidian/` so the whole repo is the vault.","x":60,"y":140,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"obsidian-note","type":"text","text":"## 💡 Note on hidden paths\n\nObsidian hides dotted directories like `.claude/` by default. File-link nodes pointing inside `.claude/` may show as broken in the file explorer even though they exist on disk. That's why this canvas uses text nodes for `.claude/` paths and file nodes only for `vault/` content.","x":480,"y":140,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"1"}
